      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EDamson Jam.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nIngredients\u003Cbr\u003E\n5 lb. of damsons.\u003Cbr\u003E\n3 lb. of lump sugar.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cb\u003EMethod.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nBoil for thirty minutes.\u003Cbr\u003E\nThen put in the sugar broken into small pieces, and boil and skim for about twenty minutes longer, or until the jam will set.\u003Cbr\u003E\nPut into pots and cover close.\u003Cbr\u003E"
